<title>USA: New York coal/ore/scrap fixtures - Feb 5.</title>
<headline>New York coal/ore/scrap fixtures - Feb 5.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danis Koper 15,000 tons scrap Odense/Iskenderun dnr $17.25 3,500/3,500 Ekinciler.</p>
<p>Lucky Rose 20,000 tons scrap Kaliningrad/Iskenderen $22.25 3,000/3,500 Ekinciler.</p>
<p>((New York Commodities Desk +1 212 859 1640))</p>
</text>
